// Global, conditional (crates/velt_loader/src/globals): `s.localeCompare(t)`
// (velt/lang/string/collate), with its table of weights, for a program that mentions
// `localeCompare`; other programs don't load the table for it.
// load when std/prelude/string uses: localeCompare
import "velt/lang/string/collate";
import "velt/lang/hooks/locale_compare";
